  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If,&nbsp;<math><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>o</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∵</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <mi>tan</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow> <mrow> <mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>tan</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>B</mi></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo><mfenced> <mrow> <mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mtext>tan</mtext><mi>A</mi></mrow> </mfenced><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mtext>tan</mtext><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow> </math><br /><br />LHS<math display=\"block\"> <mrow> <mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"[\" open=\"[\"> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"(\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>tan</mi><msup> <mn>1</mn> <mi>o</mi> </msup> <mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>tan</mi><msup> <mrow> <mn>44</mn></mrow> <mi>o</mi> </msup> <mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow> </mfenced><mo>&nbsp;</mo></mrow> </mfenced><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>tan</mi><msup> <mn>2</mn> <mi>o</mi> </msup> <mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"(\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>tan</mi><msup> <mrow> <mn>43</mn></mrow> <mi>o</mi> </msup> <mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow> </mfenced><mo>…</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"(\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>tan</mi><msup> <mrow> <mn>45</mn></mrow> <mi>o</mi> </msup> <mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow> </mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"> <mrow> <mtext>for&nbsp;each</mtext><mfenced> <mrow> <mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow> </mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfenced> <mrow> <mfrac> <mi>π</mi> <mn>4</mn> </mfrac> <mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo><msup> <mn>2</mn> <mrow> <mn>22</mn></mrow> </msup> <mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced> <mrow> <mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>23</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math> <mo>=</mo><msup> <mn>2</mn> <mi>λ</mi> </msup> </math><br /><br />then,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>23.</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Hence the sum of digits of <math> <mi>λ</mi> </math> is <math> <mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn> </math><br /><br /><math> <mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn> </math></p>"
